    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "458004c2-2f2b-40bf-8fd7-cad968995e49",
      "key": "6b7b1295-cce1-4021-b9d3-68c3009d0b2d",
      "values": []
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "d99e35c1-ca11-4f13-a74a-01c36173a6fe",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E4* \u0026amp; 5* hotels\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHalf board accommodation\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll excursions, guided tours \u0026amp; entrance fees included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EProfessional tour manager\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flights to Amman\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach in Jordan\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOne free place per 15 paying passengers\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "What\u0027s included in this tour is entirely yours to customise to suit your group\u0027s budget and preferences. Here is what we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "c33e4686-8769-450f-ab15-2ca913a834ba",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EFour nights at the 4* Amman International Hotel in Amman and three nights in the 5* Hyatt Zaman Hotel outside Petra. Both ideally situated for our itinerary and each featuring a restaurant and outdoor pool, at both hotels we stay on half board basis. All rooms are en suite.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Where you stay is entirely yours to choose to match your group\u0027s preferences. Here is our suggested accommodation:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "4f0e3b23-6f79-4355-a57a-049c5b126f15",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGreco-Roman Decapolis city of Jerash\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAncient Moabite city of Madaba\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMount Nebo, site of Moses\u2019 last camp after the Exodus\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKerak, the 12th century crusaders\u2019 castle\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EVast rose-red city of Petra\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe Treasury\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWadi Rum with 4x4 jeep driveto explore the land of Lawrence of Arabia\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EDead Sea\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E7th \u0026amp; 8th centuries Desert Castles - Qasr Amra, Qasr Kharaneh and Qasr Azraq\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "The places your group visits are exclusively yours to decide. Here are the main sights we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "de535189-b468-4594-8118-f303bac50e3c",
      "key": "bd413c75-de01-4fb6-83d9-9af583a72868",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Tailor your sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ERemember that this tour is just our suggestion to provide inspiration and whet your appetite. Every one of our tours is tailor made exclusively for your group and your group alone. So if you like the look of this tour but want to alter it to suit your group, that\u2019s fine. Tell us how you want to change it and we\u2019ll send you a proposal that meets the exact requirements for your group tour. Then, combining our experience with your understanding of the profile and interests of your members, together we can fine tune the itinerary so that you get the perfect tour at the right price for your group.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "\nIf you\u0027d prefer to visit different places, or if you\u0027d like to add extra attractions that match your group\u0027s specific interests, here are some more suggestions:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "5d4b4648-85d2-476e-80ac-ea20a7174580",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1 \u2013 Amman\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flight to Amman from your preferred airport \u2013 transfer with our tour manager in our private executive coach to the 4* Amman International Hotel in Amman for a two night stay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2 \u2013 Jerash\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDrive north of Amman to the Greco-Roman Decapolis city of Jerash, boasting an unbroken chain of human occupation dating back more the 6,500 years, where we visit sights such as the ruins of the Triumphal Arch, the Amphitheatre and the Forum.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3 \u2013 Madaba, Mount Nebo \u0026amp; Kerak\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHead to the ancient Moabite city of Madaba to see a selection of the mosaics for which the city was famous during the Byzantine period and visit Saint George\u0026#39;s Church with a 6th century mosaic map of the Holy Land \u2013 Mount Nebo is the site of Moses\u2019 last camp after the Exodus and the summit from which he surveyed the Holy Land before his death \u2013 continue south through Wadi Mujib to Kerak, the 12th century crusaders\u2019 castle used to control the ancient caravan roads from Egypt to Syria \u2013 continue to the 5* Hyatt Zaman Hotel near Petra for a three night stay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4 \u2013 Petra\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe vast rose-red city of Petra was carved into the sheer rock face by the Nabataeans, who settled there more than 2,000 years ago \u2013 enter the city through the Siq, a narrow one kilometre gorge with 80 metres high cliffs \u2013 towards the end of the Siq we see the early 1st century Al-Khazneh, known as The Treasury, 30m wide and 43m high, carved out of the sheer rock face \u2013 spend time exploring Petra.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5 \u2013 Wadi Rum\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis afternoon we head south from Petra to Wadi Rum for pre-booked 4x4 wheel drive jeeps to explore the land of Lawrence of Arabia, an unusual desert terrain with towering limestone and granite cliffs.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 6 \u2013 Dead Sea\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEn route back to Amman we visit the Dead Sea, at 1,306 feet below sea level the lowest spot on earth, and enjoy the bizarre and delightful experience of \u2018floating\u2019 on the surface of buoyant waters, four times saltier than regular seawater \u2013 return to the 4* Amman International Hotel in Amman for a two night stay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 7 \u2013 Desert Castles\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe Desert Castles, Qasr Amra, Qasr Kharaneh and Qasr Azraq, built by the early Islamic Umayyad Caliphs in the 7th and 8th centuries AD include fortifications, baths, mosques, mosaic floors and painted wall frescoes.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 8 \u2013 Amman\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETransfer to airport for our scheduled flight back home.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Suggested Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Your itinerary is exclusively yours to tailor to suit your group\u0027s interests and profile of your members. Here is our suggested itinerary:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "Remember, every element of this itinerary can be adjusted. If you\u0027d like to change the days, add different activities, or adjust the pace, just let us know."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
